{
  "name": "Migrate records between systems with Claude-assisted mapping and validation",
  "flow": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "module": "util:SetVariables",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": null,
      "mapper": {
        "scope": "roundtrip",
        "variables": [
          {
            "name": "config_your_name",
            "value": "Your name — signs every outgoing message"
          },
          {
            "name": "config_your_email",
            "value": "you@example.com"
          },
          {
            "name": "config_your_company",
            "value": "Your company or brokerage"
          },
          {
            "name": "config_timezone",
            "value": "Europe/London"
          },
          {
            "name": "config_quiet_hours_start",
            "value": "21"
          },
          {
            "name": "config_quiet_hours_end",
            "value": "8"
          },
          {
            "name": "config_approval_mode",
            "value": "true"
          },
          {
            "name": "config_approver",
            "value": "#approvals — a Slack channel, or an email address"
          },
          {
            "name": "config_test_mode",
            "value": "true"
          },
          {
            "name": "config_schedule",
            "value": "scenario schedule: Manual trigger per phase"
          }
        ]
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "name": "Config (edit me)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "module": "postgres:Query",
      "version": 2,
      "parameters": {
        "continueWhenNoRes": false,
        "isToManageDataInSharedTransaction": true
      },
      "mapper": {
        "query": "SELECT 1; -- replace with your query"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 0,
          "name": "Postgres: Profile the source"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "module": "anthropic-claude:createAMessage",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {},
      "mapper": {
        "model": "claude-sonnet-5",
        "system": "You are the \"Propose the mapping\" step of the Data Migration Workflow workflow run by Agentmelt.\nTask: Reads source and target schemas with sample values and proposes field-by-field mappings with transformation notes (date formats, picklist translation, splits/merges) and a confidence per field.\n\nRules:\n- No phase runs without an explicit trigger; cutover requires a dry run that passed.\n- The mapping is confirmed by a person; the agent proposes with confidence, it does not decide.\n- The source is read-only during cutover and a tested rollback exists before the first production batch.\n- Every transformed record carries its source id for traceability.\n- Answer only from the data provided in the input. If something is missing, say so in the output instead of guessing.\n- If this step produces a message or a document, put the full text in `draft` (and a `subject` if it is an email); put a one-line summary in `summary`.\n- Set `needs_human` true whenever you are unsure, the input is unusual, or a rule above applies; a person will look at it.\n- Return valid JSON matching the output schema; no prose outside the JSON.\n\nReply with a single JSON object and nothing else: the fields the task needs, plus \"needs_human\" (true when unsure), \"confidence\" (0–1) and \"summary\" (one line).",
        "messages": [
          {
            "role": "user",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Propose the mapping.\n\nItem (map the fields your source provides here):\n{{2.text}}{{2.body}}{{2.message}}{{2.subject}}{{2.email}}{{2.name}}{{2.data}}"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "max_tokens": "2000",
        "temperature": "0.2",
        "metadata": {}
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 600,
          "y": 0,
          "name": "Claude: Propose the mapping"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "module": "json:ParseJSON",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {},
      "mapper": {
        "json": "{{3.textResponse}}"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 900,
          "y": 0,
          "name": "Parse Claude's JSON: Propose the mapping"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "module": "builtin:BasicRouter",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": null,
      "mapper": null,
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 1200,
          "y": 0,
          "name": "Gate: Propose the mapping"
        }
      },
      "routes": [
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 11,
              "module": "builtin:ThrowWarning",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {},
              "mapper": {
                "message": "Parked for a person — Propose the mapping: {{4.summary}}"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "x": 1500,
                  "y": 0,
                  "name": "Needs a person: Propose the mapping"
                }
              },
              "filter": {
                "name": "Needs a person?",
                "conditions": [
                  [
                    {
                      "a": "{{4.needs_human}}",
                      "b": "true",
                      "o": "boolean:equal"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 5,
              "module": "google-sheets:addRow",
              "version": 2,
              "parameters": {},
              "mapper": {
                "from": "drive",
                "mode": "select",
                "values": {
                  "0": "{{4.summary}}"
                },
                "sheetId": "Sheet1",
                "spreadsheetId": "",
                "includesHeaders": true,
                "insertDataOption": "INSERT_ROWS",
                "valueInputOption": "USER_ENTERED",
                "insertUnformatted": false
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "x": 1500,
                  "y": 150,
                  "name": "Google Sheets: Confirm the mapping"
                }
              },
              "filter": {
                "name": "Continue",
                "conditions": [
                  [
                    {
                      "a": "{{4.needs_human}}",
                      "b": "true",
                      "o": "boolean:notequal"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 6,
              "module": "util:SetVariables",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": null,
              "mapper": {
                "scope": "roundtrip",
                "variables": [
                  {
                    "name": "result",
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "x": 1800,
                  "y": 150,
                  "name": "Apply transformations (port the rule here)"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 7,
              "module": "util:SetVariables",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": null,
              "mapper": {
                "scope": "roundtrip",
                "variables": [
                  {
                    "name": "diff",
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "x": 2100,
                  "y": 150,
                  "name": "Validate (compare here)"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 8,
              "module": "hubspotcrm:getContact",
              "version": 2,
              "parameters": {},
              "mapper": {
                "contactId": "{{5.contactId}}"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "x": 2400,
                  "y": 150,
                  "name": "HubSpot (sandbox): Dry run"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 9,
              "module": "builtin:BasicFeeder",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {},
              "mapper": {
                "array": "{{8.items}}"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "x": 2700,
                  "y": 150,
                  "name": "Iterate: Cut over in batches"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 10,
              "module": "google-docs:createADocument",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {},
              "mapper": {
                "name": "{{4.subject}}",
                "content": "{{4.draft}}",
                "destination": "drive",
                "folderId": ""
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "x": 3000,
                  "y": 150,
                  "name": "Google Docs: Reconcile and hand over"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "instant": false,
    "version": 1,
    "scenario": {
      "roundtrips": 1,
      "maxErrors": 3,
      "autoCommit": true,
      "autoCommitTriggerLast": true,
      "sequential": false,
      "slots": null,
      "confidential": false,
      "dataloss": false,
      "dlq": false,
      "freshVariables": false
    },
    "designer": {
      "orphans": []
    },
    "notes": [
      {
        "moduleIds": [
          1
        ],
        "content": "## Migrate records between systems with Claude-assisted mapping and validation\n\nOps and engineering teams moving data from one CRM, help desk or database to another without a migration vendor.\n\n### How it works\nTrigger: Each phase — profile, map, validate, dry-run, cutover — starts on an explicit click; no phase runs unattended.\n1. Profile the source\n2. Propose the mapping\n3. Confirm the mapping\n4. Apply transformations\n5. Validate\n6. Dry run\n7. Cut over in batches\n8. Reconcile and hand over\nEvery AI step is followed by a \"Needs a person?\" gate that parks low-confidence items; the write-back waits for an approval.\n\n### Setup\n1. Open \"Config (edit me)\" and fill in the fields (names, approver, quiet hours, thresholds).\n2. Add credentials: Anthropic, plus Postgres / BigQuery, Target APIs (HubSpot, Salesforce, Zendesk…).\n3. Run once with test_mode on, read the output, then switch the trigger on.\n\n### Customization tips\nPut the source and target schemas in the Config node; run each phase (profile, map, validate, dry-run, cutover) by hand from the manual trigger.\nGuardrail to keep: No phase runs without an explicit trigger; cutover requires a dry run that passed.\n\nFull blueprint: https://agentmelt.com/workflows/data-migration-automation/",
        "isFilterNote": false,
        "metadata": {
          "color": "#F5D451"
        }
      }
    ],
    "zone": "eu1.make.com"
  }
}